            <ab xml:id="MP1026_trl-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p2-l1"/>MN
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p2-l2"/>dʾṭbwlcmṭrˈ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP1026_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>zaydār ud mahistag ī pad *Asp-gurd deh
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>rōz Ardwahišt ◯ Burzēn-Pērōz ī pādixšāy az ēd
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>*Asp-gurd deh pēš man āmad zan ī Sazā nām ī 
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>pādixšāy mardān ī Xwāst-Dēlān nām ud ān *Asp-gurd deh 
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>mānēd duxt ī az būd ud dastwarīh ud wizīr ud paymān
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>ī Xwāst-Dēlān andar Burzēn-Pērōz kard ud āwišt paydāg ō
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>zanīh(?) Burzēn-Pērōz madan ud Sazā pad ān wizīr
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>dastwarīh ēw-čand tā pad zanīh ī Burzēn-Pērōz nibištan
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>Dādgušnasp ī dibīr ī az *Asp-gurd deh Sazā rāy 
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>az zanīh ī Burzēn-Pērōz zāyendag pahrēxtan ud az ǰāmag
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>ud  xwāstag ī pad mašk ī čand ud payrāyag ī abāg ǰahist hā̆mist
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>be bastan ud Burzēn-Pērōz abar ān xīr pēš rad wēš rēxt *paymānag
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/>garzīdan nāmag ī awēšān ud kardan-iz ī Dādgušnasp ān abēčimīh
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trc-p1-l14"/>ud adādīh pad Burzēn-Pērōz rēš wizōst nāmag ī pad muhr
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trc-p1-l15"/>ī ēwar abāg dāšt ud abar ān xīr must bawišn guft
               <lb n="16" xml:id="trc-p1-l16"/>tō wēm čiyōn Burzēn-Pērōz pad ān ēwēnag garzēd ud [ēd] xīr rāy
               <lb n="17" xml:id="trc-p1-l17"/>dehgān ud mādag ī ēd deh ud Sazā-z pōhišn xwāhēd ud az ān saxwan
               <lb n="18" xml:id="trc-p1-l18"/>āšnawēd čim ī ān tis be dānēd enyā čiyōn čim
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trc-p1-l19"/>(ī abdo)m ud saxwan ī Sazā čē-ēwēnag pad pass dādweh
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trc-p1-l20"/>(ī drōd)  nibēsēd  ud  Sazā-z  abāg  mašk xwāstagān čand (būd) 
               <lb n="21" xml:id="trc-p1-l21"/>ī Burzēn-Pērōz ham pad nāmčišt gōwēd ud man pēš tō āyēm
               <lb n="22" xml:id="trc-p1-l22"/>ud pašt-iz druxt ī abāyēd niyāz (čim) māh
               <lb n="23" xml:id="trc-p1-l23"/>Frawardīn ī sāl
               <lb n="24" xml:id="trc-p1-l24"/>106
               <lb n="25" xml:id="trc-p1-l25"/>rōz
               <lb n="26" xml:id="trc-p1-l26"/>(Ardwahišt)
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP1026_trc-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p2-l1"/>az
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p2-l2"/>dādborzmihr
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP1026_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>(To the) *keeper of the archives and the Elder in the village of *Asp-gurd
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>Day Ardwahišt (3rd day). ◯ Burzēn-Pērōz, pādixšāy, from this
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>village of *Asp-gurd came before me: the wife, Sazā by name,
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>pādixšāy, the people of Xwāst-Dēlān and who live (mānēd, line 5) in the village of *Asp-gurd
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>(and) the daughter who is also from there. The statement and entitlement and judement and agreement
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>which made and sealed Xwāst-Dēlān for Burzēn-Pērōz
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>came to be revealed to entering in marriage with Burzēn-Pērōz and Sazā (who has) the entitlement by this judgement
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>as long as she is in matrimony with Burzēn-Pērōz [M]
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>Dādgušnasp the scribe from the village of *Asp-gurd because of Sazā
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>investigating on the marriage to Burzēn-Pērōz how it was to be cared for and with regard to the goblets
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trans-p1-l11"/>and much wealth in a bag and jewellery being together with it by chance
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trans-p1-l12"/>how everything (hā̆mist, line 11) was to be tied up. And Burzēn-Pērōz on this matter before the Rad sifted (the evidence) to that extent
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trans-p1-l13"/>to be complained in a letter on these things and also to write so by Dādgušnasp on the groundlessness
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trans-p1-l14"/>and injustice for the loss of Burzēn-Pērōz to be investigated and the document with assured (line 15) seal to be kept (line 15) together
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trans-p1-l15"/>there is growing complaint on this matter to say:
               <lb n="16" xml:id="trans-p1-l16"/>You (are) obstinate (lit. “rock”) when Burzēn-Pērōz (still) complains in this way and because of [this] matter
               <lb n="17" xml:id="trans-p1-l17"/>he would inquire about bribery of the farmers and (their) wives and also Sazā. And from that statement
               <lb n="18" xml:id="trans-p1-l18"/>he will hear of the reason of the matter he should know, moreover how the final (line 19) reason
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trans-p1-l19"/>and statement by Sazā what exactly as answer
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trans-p1-l20"/>of (rightness ?) he should write down and also Sazā and how much walth in the bag
               <lb n="21" xml:id="trans-p1-l21"/>which Burzēn-Pērōz will confirm is particular and I am coming before you
               <lb n="22" xml:id="trans-p1-l22"/>(for explaining) the reason why he was cheated even of the agreement: month
               <lb n="23" xml:id="trans-p1-l23"/>Frawardīn of the year
               <lb n="24" xml:id="trans-p1-l24"/>106,
               <lb n="25" xml:id="trans-p1-l25"/>day
               <lb n="26" xml:id="trans-p1-l26"/>Ardwahišt (3rd day). 
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP1026_trans-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p2-l1"/>From
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p2-l2"/>Dādborzmihr
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>